WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
Reading a page in Work.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.909
Put the sidebar away to read.

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:22.991
Ask for a Launch section with the four docs.

00:00:22.991 --> 00:00:27.991
The assistant edits the workspace files.

00:00:27.991 --> 00:00:32.291
The sidebar changes in place; the page stays.

00:00:32.291 --> 00:00:35.291
The assistant explains what it changed.

00:00:35.291 --> 00:00:57.590
Ask for a tool that reads your own chats.

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:06.590
It writes a workflow and an app, then builds them.

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:08.990
The app lands in the sidebar.

00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:15.782
Work asks once before the app reads your chats.

00:01:15.782 --> 00:01:23.305
A tool that looks built in, showing your own work.
